# Katcha break-glass recipients are PUBLIC keys only.
# Generate an offline identity:
#   age-keygen -o katcha-breakglass.identity
# Print its public recipient:
#   age-keygen -y katcha-breakglass.identity
#
# Replace the placeholder below with one or more real age recipients.
# Never commit the corresponding identity/private key.
age1REPLACE_WITH_REAL_OFFLINE_RECIPIENT
